{"summary":"五羽石，又称金黄，性味未详，功能轻身延年。生于海水中蓬葭山，颜色金黄如金。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"《别录》曰︰主轻身长年。一名金黄，生海水中蓬葭山中，黄如金。","translation":"《别录》记载：能使身体轻健、延长寿命。别名金黄，生长在海水中的蓬葭山，颜色黄如金。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#五羽石","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}